# Tea Domain Contract Suite for cordon-public (cordon-control)
name: cordon-control-domain-contract
description: Verifies live health and baseline API contract for cordon-public on loopback port 8095
steps:
  - name: health-probe
    http:
      method: GET
      url: "http://127.0.0.1:8095/health"
    expect:
      status: 200
